dV5qc2WS0t0Q7kNvwH7ygC-&_nc_oc=Adq67Xdjl-MoR46Oq6XuLgxo_hhGrPcX_CjJ2L0PoNm2LrzGeL71id1PQRAIHU-LxNQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDJPjT9_5vp0zMhDSYYzbCVTpHP_-JlshjFbVP-pc5QPw&oe=6A637337"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=msutO6fJPEoQ7kNvwFAdNso&_nc_oc=Adq9o9m7Q0q_eIPYQAF9J31532KW-B4JrDD3D7eKEvLmEbGswmVfJK5z2NIBtWXrSJ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAcxqo3NxQ_g_lV4WSHTlNQn5hW8KODtDd-qpTnmLX5cA&oe=6A6374CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_UYE6rkoPL0Q7kNvwG_ftsi&_nc_oc=Adog7PR_48VNZlw4VWmkddg3NOI9bKVuYTS3y6tmGDq4nF0CHl8PT1INzNldFFjE2Rg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBl6kR9JdJgMe813x_9bYnvMES16oMn8aKd4fYUnfzJlQ&oe=6A6361EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YCHhd6d1x8AQ7kNvwFC_o9u&_nc_oc=AdqG6nUkaVvR6dLBdYy7jn2hVVGHGVR0qoGug2v9OCptNJZUNcUFFJjhM_OIAMF5ZXg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQChhPmdyVSgGJqXGiZrYVRDhxobXWiYTSWbI1hhE9Z08Q&oe=6A638383"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VBVSu4VDgi4Q7kNvwEQneaj&_nc_oc=Adr4XWhucQtp3tSK8IXMy5T48m_LFH2b5zIuQExg7f00J6sUdCYQiDeR6o16hqQJ3rc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBozX1GGeWp9UfBL6lsycq0W829vSZU2n16iw0-x67KuQ&oe=6A637BD8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=un2j_ISN5FgQ7kNvwEAjFtD&_nc_oc=Adoy_5D9gmX2ceMonDZx6BohmoNaR5jIQoZsm_pW_jFYPJYNqAmmI4QnebgHmC3KlXM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDo4fzF2EkTciaTgCzQ0mTyzTdt62Jy3F-9djsSzEDhCA&oe=6A6356BC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080